    'gaoshan' => ['upper_lower_ensemble', '台湾原住民族多个不同群体的行政合称范围，不能视为单一服饰社区', 'An administrative umbrella covering multiple distinct Indigenous peoples in Taiwan, not one dress community', '一张服装照片不能用“高山族”笼统确认具体族群、部落、年代、身份或仪式角色；必须优先使用具体群体自称。', 'One dress image cannot use the umbrella label Gaoshan to establish a particular people, community, date, identity, or ritual role; specific self-identification takes priority.'],
